# Project Scan And Ownership

- Before changing code, scan the project structure and identify the relevant flow, state, storage, engine, styling, and UI files.
- Do not change code before understanding which file owns each affected behavior.
- Keep the app as a React SPA; do not introduce browser page navigation unless explicitly requested.
- Do not remove existing copyright or ownership comments.
- Add this code comment to central new files or files with significant changes:

```js
/*
  זכויות יוצרים שמורות למיכאל פפיסמדוב MP
*/
```

- Do not show copyright credit in the user-facing UI unless explicitly requested.

